{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0544_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c2f198dba71e0ea369f8825b7818709cc0e806faeec4283b11d318a856d3b4c3", "ja": "（今日は静香がプロデュースした服の取材だった。\nちょっとしたトラブルはあったが、なんとか終わった）", "zh": "（今天是静香设计的服装采访。虽然出了点小状况，但总算顺利结束了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0544_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9480d2be0f7f92a28f2e91296be776b5e39f5bfa868fe12afb91e31bcd32ce73", "ja": "お疲れ様。それと、ありがとうな。\n静香のおかげで、無事に終わったよ。", "zh": "辛苦了。另外，也谢谢你。\n多亏了静香，顺利结束了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0544_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "a4e34b124c6a07544e19022ac9e5512f568099af635662d4b5b9a0db950cdeb0", "ja": "気にしないでください。少しビックリしましたけど\n時間通りに終わってよかったです。", "zh": "请别在意。虽然稍微吓了一跳，\n不过能按时结束真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0544_1003_p", "source_sha256": "c84c916a6127142cc38b9e15cee8479964a43630afa1836feb587588d74d3365", "ja": "ああ。今日も静香が対応してくれたから、助かったよ。\nしかし……最近の静香は頼りになるよ。", "zh": "啊。今天也是静香帮忙处理的，真是帮大忙了。\n不过……最近的静香越来越可靠了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0544_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "83b96bfbca14ff1873275072998482062626efb41c2127845a75bc11bc22cd4f", "ja": "そ、そうですか……ふふ。\n少し前から、視野を広く持とうと意識してるんです。", "zh": "这、这样啊……呵呵。\n从前段时间开始，我就一直在提醒自己要放开视野。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0544_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "a4e72364de9f6d1587cc21848210dc4ae1fec831861fe88844c69f983493fc0d", "ja": "このみさんや風花さんは、周りをよく見ているなと\n思って。だから練習ってわけじゃないですけど……。", "zh": "因为我觉得，这奈美小姐和风花小姐总是在留意周围的情况。虽然也不能算是在练习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0544_1006_p", "source_sha256": "893880a3d8492d8b081ce7f6427cff164cc66ed3c942e3a7e009864c39f05314", "ja": "いいじゃないか！\nでも、いつの間にそんな目標を立てたんだ？", "zh": "这样不是很好吗！\n不过，你是什么时候定下这个目标的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0544_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "95e2ed8f979fc9380b2a1e5f966c374963b66f9e79fd66388a06fffbfaa647ae", "ja": "それは……\nこの服のプロデュースが始まった頃ですね。", "zh": "那个啊……\n是在开始负责这套服装的制作时。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0544_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e27c5cbbf82acc5f0743c4b141d9d5a3de322ca1efa1464d418a76dbecd0ca18", "ja": "本当に最近なんだな。", "zh": "确实是最近才开始的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0544_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "f09659c7faa7e856e673f6be38993c59b80ba3fcf6481fce3d1c21605adbfb93", "ja": "はい。洋服のプロデュースとか初めてで……\nどんな服にしようか、すごく悩んだんです。", "zh": "是的。因为之前从没做过服装设计……\n我一直在烦恼该设计成什么样的服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0544_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "efb69d7169035e5659818195a3134b46706cfb5efa7c9adc5cc043a8fdf276d6", "ja": "たくさん考えて……その中で思い浮かんだんです。\n大人の私に着ててほしい服にしたいって。", "zh": "我想了很多……然后想到了。\n想做成一件希望长大后的我能穿上的衣服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0544_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a56f0824dcf9627451c0c5cfa62cc5739186d02d6a65e13983cef54581a18c0f", "ja": "大人になった静香か……。\nじゃあ、その服は静香の理想だな。", "zh": "长大成人的静香啊……\n那么，那套衣服就是静香的理想了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0544_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "3da4f9b87e7dfaaae145cf84d24e0f9ba423540bfb66901ab4d5e6772c4868fd", "ja": "そうですね。『冷静で自信があって、カッコいい大人』\n……そんな風になれたらいいですね。", "zh": "是啊。『冷静、自信又帅气的大人』\n……要是能成为那样就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0544_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "7f2318e1e9d241ad41ba34c37bb80a2cf4207e9aebbd8946b5ad3f23c16ce725", "ja": "だけど何もしないままじゃ、理想には近づけません。\nそれで、まずは意識を変えてみようと。", "zh": "但是，什么都不做的话，是无法接近理想的。\n所以，我想先试着改变自己的意识。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0544_1014_p", "source_sha256": "8ef200fc61fee38bd7334db5524eda08659b162cc9f60e65dc9cf25e4b5ee088", "ja": "なるほど。\n意識づけの成果が、さっきの対応だったんだな。", "zh": "原来如此。\n刚才的应对，就是改变意识的成果啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0544_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "37a0276ca5dd2e3c5268126a9152191ab499a2af15fe84315402fc0ed73a45da", "ja": "はい。本当は、私もすごく慌ててたんです。取材の人も\n混乱してましたし。でもその時、この服が目に入って。", "zh": "是的。其实我当时也特别慌张。采访的人也都乱了阵脚。不过那时候，我注意到了这身衣服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0544_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "854c7279afe3b8bed20874fce26a3958bed220a8c1de9b6bb0cad0abc3b7df34", "ja": "理想の大人なら、こういう時はどうする？って考えたら\nなんだか冷静になれました。", "zh": "想到理想中的大人在这种时候会怎么做，我不知不觉就冷静下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0544_1017_p", "source_sha256": "448c2bab0edfceff41f67fcb5219fd747d5c23058e3f75d1c8d3ffdef487a486", "ja": "そうか……。\nあの時の静香は、カッコよかったからな。", "zh": "这样啊……  \n因为那时候的静香很帅气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0544_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "523efb0194e8f8bec88192a60ea4aa370e206bd68d01f9db409a1f94129aa76e", "ja": "ありがとうございます。でも……理想はまだまだです。\nもっと、いろんな人を参考にしないと……！", "zh": "谢谢您。不过……距离我的理想还差得远呢。\n我还得多参考其他人才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0544_1019_p", "source_sha256": "e3fe343cca3fab352eb9ac066d4d58b64ed80f580ff965f4ad88be9e97070744", "ja": "それなら、話を聞いてみたらどうだ？\n静香が質問すれば、喜んで答えてくれると思うよ。", "zh": "那样的话，要不要去听听她们的想法？\n我想静香去问的话，她们一定会很乐意回答的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0544_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "a7f8bf49ed26c09fa2ca253ec9bedaacf3e5619e5c59ccef10e68c24ed142fe2", "ja": "そうですね！　莉緒さんや歌織さんに\n聞いてみたいと思います。素敵な大人になる方法を。", "zh": "是的！我想去问问莉绪小姐和歌织小姐，怎样才能成为优秀的大人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0544_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "4bcc878afea1a11191830725d3ee2ec251b3f6cc5d4148a54b844a3c47d77d0e", "ja": "社長や小鳥さんにも、質問したいことがあって。\nあ、{$P$}は……。", "zh": "我也想向社长和小鸟女士请教一些问题。\n啊，{$P$}的话……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0544_1022_p", "source_sha256": "a3fa1003b0bc7c5a851241f3c16183de60d6bd5943bac58a8fc26953a3cb4aaf", "ja": "（ドキドキ……）", "zh": "（心怦怦跳……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0544_1023_015siz", "source_sha256": "43fdc0a9dff79048fd1c18c3cd1254307eae18c3f1f07412c2f8d8228eb84f2e", "ja": "特には……。いつも、そばで見てますからね。\n話を聞かなくても、なんとなくわかります。ふふっ。", "zh": "没什么特别的……因为我一直都在身边看着您呢。\n就算不听您说，也能大概明白。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
